  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&amp;nbsp;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;EP-303 REV 2, &amp;nbsp;EP-304\r\nREV2, BL-300 REV 2, BL303 REV 2, Correspondence, afc Commissioning Compliance\r\nCorrespondence, EP-300 Rev 2, EP-301 REV 2, Design &amp;amp; Access Statement, Parking\r\nArrangement, Planning Statement, Energy Certificate, &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;HMO Licence&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The site shall only be used as a&amp;nbsp;Residential Family Assessment Centre (C2)&amp;nbsp;and not for any other uses falling within Use Class (C2), or for any other purposes, unless an alternative use is agreed in writing by the local planning authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The new Residential Family Assessment Centre (C2) hereby permitted shall not be occupied by more than 3.no families and 3.no members of staff, and no more than 9 occupants overrall,&amp;nbsp; at any given time (unless any substantive changes are otherwise agreed in writing with the LPA).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall not be occupied until details and location of adequate short and long (with details of a covered, accessible and secure enclosure) cycle storage to meet London Plan Standards has been submitted to, and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The development shall be carried out in accordance with the details as so agreed, and the storage provision shall be in place prior to the first occupation of the development, and retained thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;_32c3e30089cdc958 _0233f006565b0368&quot;&gt;Prior to first occupation of the development as a Residential Family Assessment Centre (Use Class C2), details of waste and recycling storage facilities, including arrangements for collection, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved facilities shall be provided before first occupation and retained thereafter for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fd03a365b9240378&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
